(375923, 31857, 10867, '<td valign="top">This photo does a good job of providing equivalents for the human actors and Priscilla (the vehicle) in the movie.  The image seems to tip just a little bit to the left.  You might want to try rotating it to the right a fraction.</td>', 'This photo does a good job of providing equivalents for the human actors and Priscilla (the vehicle) in the movie.  The image seems to tip just a little bit to the left.  You might want to try rotating it to the right a fraction.', '2003-08-04 03:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(375926, 31778, 10867, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about this imitating a scene from the movie, but it''s a beautifully sharp, clear and well set up shot.</td>', 'I don''t know about this imitating a scene from the movie, but it''s a beautifully sharp, clear and well set up shot.', '2003-08-04 03:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(375928, 31838, 10867, '<td valign="top">The shot is nicely composed.  Both the hand and the ring seem a bit soft in focus, though.</td>', 'The shot is nicely composed.  Both the hand and the ring seem a bit soft in focus, though.', '2003-08-04 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(375934, 31817, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of black and white in the composition.  There''s a tiny spot in the top left hand corner (a stuck pixel?) that should be cloned out.  Also, if this were mine, I''d clone out the two black dots showing on the bottom frame below the ace.  They tend to draw the eye to themselves and so are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very nice use of black and white in the composition.  There''s a tiny spot in the top left hand corner (a stuck pixel?) that should be cloned out.  Also, if this were mine, I''d clone out the two black dots showing on the bottom frame below the ace.  They tend to draw the eye to themselves and so are a bit distracting.', '2003-08-04 03:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(375939, 31804, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a fun picture and it certainly does recall the movie.  I''m a bit bothered, though, by the colour cast that makes parts of the boy''s skin look quite blue.  Also the little spot at the end of the boy''s nose is a bit distracting.  I would clone it out.</td>', 'This is a fun picture and it certainly does recall the movie.  I''m a bit bothered, though, by the colour cast that makes parts of the boy''s skin look quite blue.  Also the little spot at the end of the boy''s nose is a bit distracting.  I would clone it out.', '2003-08-04 03:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
