(375960, 31855, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I would have liked this more if the stuff wasn''t in the foreground. The chairs might have been alright but the thing in the center (air mattress?) is distracting.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I would have liked this more if the stuff wasn''t in the foreground. The chairs might have been alright but the thing in the center (air mattress?) is distracting.', '2003-08-04 05:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
