(376042, 31768, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see three times "psycho" in this challenge and yours is by far the best. A clear and threathening knife and the silhouette of a women in the background. Good use of light and shadow. Only suggestion for improvement : in the top right corner behing the hand and knife-end there is a dark object/shadow and because of that you can''t see the outline of the knife any longer. It would have been better with a lighter background also in that corner. Can''t vote yet but you would have gotten a 9 from me.</td>', 'I see three times "psycho" in this challenge and yours is by far the best. A clear and threathening knife and the silhouette of a women in the background. Good use of light and shadow. Only suggestion for improvement : in the top right corner behing the hand and knife-end there is a dark object/shadow and because of that you can''t see the outline of the knife any longer. It would have been better with a lighter background also in that corner. Can''t vote yet but you would have gotten a 9 from me.', '2003-08-04 07:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
