(376049, 31622, 6349, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  The focus, colors, and lighting are super.  I like photos like this that make me think about other possible subjects.  You could do a whole series on pinball machines.  It would be very interesting.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Love this shot.  The focus, colors, and lighting are super.  I like photos like this that make me think about other possible subjects.  You could do a whole series on pinball machines.  It would be very interesting.  Great job.  9', '2003-08-04 07:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(376050, 30912, 6349, '<td valign="top">This shot is sooo freaky!  I''m not familiar with the movie, but I''m sure it exists.  If it doesn''t, it should; I hate the dentist.  That''s one big friggin needle.  The models are perfecty believable.  The rolling eyes and wide open screaming mouth really fit the scene and the shadows are, um, well perfect.  I hope this gets a ribbon.  10</td>', 'This shot is sooo freaky!  I''m not familiar with the movie, but I''m sure it exists.  If it doesn''t, it should; I hate the dentist.  That''s one big friggin needle.  The models are perfecty believable.  The rolling eyes and wide open screaming mouth really fit the scene and the shadows are, um, well perfect.  I hope this gets a ribbon.  10', '2003-08-04 07:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
