(376174, 31850, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, good dof, interesting composition. However, I think you either needed more detail in the rest of the shot other than the teeth, or less detail. As it is, it doesn''t look deliberate enough. I think you could have done with a little less negative space to the left... or right, either would have done! 7</td>', 'Nicely lit, good dof, interesting composition. However, I think you either needed more detail in the rest of the shot other than the teeth, or less detail. As it is, it doesn''t look deliberate enough. I think you could have done with a little less negative space to the left... or right, either would have done! 7', '2003-08-04 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(376175, 31545, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, beautiful colours. I feel this could have done better without the swans being placed in the centre, and without the horizon cutting across the middle here. Symmetry like that is rarely effective. Swans are a little small, did they come closer? 7</td>', 'Lovely shot, beautiful colours. I feel this could have done better without the swans being placed in the centre, and without the horizon cutting across the middle here. Symmetry like that is rarely effective. Swans are a little small, did they come closer? 7', '2003-08-04 10:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(376176, 31854, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great vintage feel to this photo, I like the level of contrast. I think it could have benefited from some sharpening though. 7</td>', 'Great vintage feel to this photo, I like the level of contrast. I think it could have benefited from some sharpening though. 7', '2003-08-04 10:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(376177, 31845, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... he looks like he is about to strike, so in my opinion the knife should be higher. Shame about the baggy top, the silhouette would have worked better with a closer fitting shirt. Compositionally this doesn''t quite work for me, perhaps it needs more negative space to the left. 7</td>', 'Nice shot... he looks like he is about to strike, so in my opinion the knife should be higher. Shame about the baggy top, the silhouette would have worked better with a closer fitting shirt. Compositionally this doesn''t quite work for me, perhaps it needs more negative space to the left. 7', '2003-08-04 10:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
