(376434, 31858, 3018, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, and a nice result.  I would''ve liked to see a girl, with long hair, to represent more closely the movie.  I like this movie a lot, because it really scared me when I was a kid.</td>', 'Cool idea, and a nice result.  I would''ve liked to see a girl, with long hair, to represent more closely the movie.  I like this movie a lot, because it really scared me when I was a kid.', '2003-08-04 15:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(376435, 31836, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition and colors.  A little bit dark but I like it because it sets a mood.  I haven''t seen the movie, but have seen the trailers and it looks good.  I can see some jagged lines, maybe due to compression.  Be careful with your editing software.</td>', 'Very cool composition and colors.  A little bit dark but I like it because it sets a mood.  I haven''t seen the movie, but have seen the trailers and it looks good.  I can see some jagged lines, maybe due to compression.  Be careful with your editing software.', '2003-08-04 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(376438, 31842, 3018, '<td valign="top">This is one of the bets pictures in the challenge, as it closely tries to mimic a scene from the movie.  The bench, suit, shoes, briefcase, pose, etc are very good.  I don''t want to sound that perfectionist, but his face seems to tough to be Forrest Gump.  Ha!  Don''t take this last comment too serious.  Your picture is very good, and perfect for the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is one of the bets pictures in the challenge, as it closely tries to mimic a scene from the movie.  The bench, suit, shoes, briefcase, pose, etc are very good.  I don''t want to sound that perfectionist, but his face seems to tough to be Forrest Gump.  Ha!  Don''t take this last comment too serious.  Your picture is very good, and perfect for the challenge.  Good luck!', '2003-08-04 15:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(376439, 30912, 3018, '<td valign="top">This has the look of an old fashioned horror movie.  From the 1950s.  Very good!</td>', 'This has the look of an old fashioned horror movie.  From the 1950s.  Very good!', '2003-08-04 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
