(376532, 31768, 7291, '<td valign="top">Of all the attempts at Psycho in the challenge, this is by far the best.  You have the knife, the silhouette of the girl in the shower, and perfect lighting.  The only problem I see is that the original scene was at night wasn''t it?  Oh well, that would''ve been much more difficult to shoot.  Great job! - 10</td>', 'Of all the attempts at Psycho in the challenge, this is by far the best.  You have the knife, the silhouette of the girl in the shower, and perfect lighting.  The only problem I see is that the original scene was at night wasn''t it?  Oh well, that would''ve been much more difficult to shoot.  Great job! - 10', '2003-08-04 16:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
