(376542, 31834, 7291, '<td valign="top">It appears as if the on-board camera flash was used for this, which makes the lighting just a bit harsh IMHO, however, the idea was executed well.  Many people missed the point with this challenge and that''s to re-create a scene, not take a picture of something with a similar name as the movie.  This picture fits the challenge well.</td>', 'It appears as if the on-board camera flash was used for this, which makes the lighting just a bit harsh IMHO, however, the idea was executed well.  Many people missed the point with this challenge and that''s to re-create a scene, not take a picture of something with a similar name as the movie.  This picture fits the challenge well.', '2003-08-04 16:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(376543, 31273, 7291, '<td valign="top">This would have a better effect if the toy soldier on the left was cropped out and the shadow had more contrast.  Great idea though.</td>', 'This would have a better effect if the toy soldier on the left was cropped out and the shadow had more contrast.  Great idea though.', '2003-08-04 16:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(376544, 31633, 7291, '<td valign="top">You''ve used this before haven''t you?  For the post card challenge.  Anyway, this fits the challenge well.  I think a dawn or dusk shot would have a more "movie-like" feel to it but now I ''m just being nit-picky.</td>', 'You''ve used this before haven''t you?  For the post card challenge.  Anyway, this fits the challenge well.  I think a dawn or dusk shot would have a more "movie-like" feel to it but now I ''m just being nit-picky.', '2003-08-04 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
