(377248, 31858, 7086, '<td valign="top">My voting criteria for this challenge are:<br/> <br/>1. Did you capture a scene from the movie (as the challenge brief states) or did you enter a picture and fit a title to it.<br/>2. How close a rendition is your image to the movie.<br/>3. How does the image stand up in its own right.<br/> <br/>In this case:<br/> <br/>1. Pretty safe to assume that you took this photo for the challenge and this film.<br/>2. I think this is a good rendidtion of the scene, colour may have helped though. <br/>3. Using the TV as the light source has unfortunately lead to under-exposure in most of the image, exposing for the head and body would have shown more detail in the image. <br/> <br/></td>', 'My voting criteria for this challenge are: 1. Did you capture a scene from the movie (as the challenge brief states) or did you enter a picture and fit a title to it.2. How close a rendition is your image to the movie.3. How does the image stand up in its own right. In this case: 1. Pretty safe to assume that you took this photo for the challenge and this film.2. I think this is a good rendidtion of the scene, colour may have helped though. 3. Using the TV as the light source has unfortunately lead to under-exposure in most of the image, exposing for the head and body would have shown more detail in the image.  ', '2003-08-05 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
