(377426, 31808, 4967, '<td valign="top">Now THAT looks like a fun party!  What luck to have this during the week of the challenge.  I think I would have cropped quite a bit off the top of this, made it a longer photo... might have helped to bring something into the main subject...</td>', 'Now THAT looks like a fun party!  What luck to have this during the week of the challenge.  I think I would have cropped quite a bit off the top of this, made it a longer photo... might have helped to bring something into the main subject...', '2003-08-05 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
