(377657, 31811, 2879, '<td valign="top">Grotesque, but lovely tonal range and good composition!</td>', 'Grotesque, but lovely tonal range and good composition!', '2003-08-05 21:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(377727, 31605, 10828, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderull expression, almost human like.</td>', 'Such a wonderull expression, almost human like.', '2003-08-05 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(377732, 31805, 7778, '<td valign="top">Capture (timing), composition and focus are gorgeous. The inclusion of the (busy) background is a little distracting (could have been panned at shigh shutter speed?). The image is also precariously close to being oversharpened. Still... a great moment well captured.</td>', 'Capture (timing), composition and focus are gorgeous. The inclusion of the (busy) background is a little distracting (could have been panned at shigh shutter speed?). The image is also precariously close to being oversharpened. Still... a great moment well captured.', '2003-08-06 00:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(377757, 31834, 7778, '<td valign="top">Not having seen this movie... the image, outside of the movie context, is not quite credible. The artifacts are just too ostentiously chosen and laid out, leaving out any indication of chaos or oversight, i.e. of those things that often accompany tragedy. The emphasized proximity of camera and photographer, also, contributes to this effect or feeling.<br/> <br/>The lighting, although kept appropiately dark, still clearly outlines the ''busier'' (and redundant) outlines of furniture and/or objects (top left and centre). <br/> <br/>The pose (communicating despair and grief) could be greatly concincing, IMO, if the subject were ''diminished'' in the same way that tragedy diminishes man.</td>', 'Not having seen this movie... the image, outside of the movie context, is not quite credible. The artifacts are just too ostentiously chosen and laid out, leaving out any indication of chaos or oversight, i.e. of those things that often accompany tragedy. The emphasized proximity of camera and photographer, also, contributes to this effect or feeling. The lighting, although kept appropiately dark, still clearly outlines the ''busier'' (and redundant) outlines of furniture and/or objects (top left and centre).  The pose (communicating despair and grief) could be greatly concincing, IMO, if the subject were ''diminished'' in the same way that tragedy diminishes man.', '2003-08-06 00:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(377772, 31786, 259, '<td valign="top">nice rabbit picture, but a stretch for recreating a movie scene from roger rabbit.  aside from the challenge it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'nice rabbit picture, but a stretch for recreating a movie scene from roger rabbit.  aside from the challenge it''s a nice shot.', '2003-08-06 00:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(377775, 31857, 259, '<td valign="top">haha, those are some muscular women.  jk</td>', 'haha, those are some muscular women.  jk', '2003-08-06 00:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(377781, 31847, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the extra texture in the shower curtian</td>', 'i like the extra texture in the shower curtian', '2003-08-06 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(377797, 31525, 259, '<td valign="top">very cool, don''t know how many people will be able to cross their eyes though.  even so, its still clockwork oragney.</td>', 'very cool, don''t know how many people will be able to cross their eyes though.  even so, its still clockwork oragney.', '2003-08-06 00:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(377831, 31789, 7778, '<td valign="top">I find this capture a little difficult to comment on. <br/> <br/>The way it is rendered the viewer seems confronted by four almost disparate planes: the foreground, although apparently rich with crisply turbulent is almost unintelligible due to (what appears to be) excessive sharpness. The fog obsuring both water reflection and the feet of things (bridge pile-on, tree and shore) appears wonderfully silky with a nice tonal gradation from front to back. The bridge structure is partially obliterated (central sections) by processing (?). The treed shoreline (background left), however, pales as if placed under a milky film, when compared to  the foregorund. It appears, as if differing post-processes were applied to parts of the image.</td>', 'I find this capture a little difficult to comment on.  The way it is rendered the viewer seems confronted by four almost disparate planes: the foreground, although apparently rich with crisply turbulent is almost unintelligible due to (what appears to be) excessive sharpness. The fog obsuring both water reflection and the feet of things (bridge pile-on, tree and shore) appears wonderfully silky with a nice tonal gradation from front to back. The bridge structure is partially obliterated (central sections) by processing (?). The treed shoreline (background left), however, pales as if placed under a milky film, when compared to  the foregorund. It appears, as if differing post-processes were applied to parts of the image.', '2003-08-06 00:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(377834, 31852, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good tones and exposure. I think the composition would have been stronger with more of the rod and line showing and more of the river.</td>', 'Good tones and exposure. I think the composition would have been stronger with more of the rod and line showing and more of the river.', '2003-08-06 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(377835, 31842, 8367, '<td valign="top">You did a great job on this. Bumping it up to a 10.</td>', 'You did a great job on this. Bumping it up to a 10.', '2003-08-06 00:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(377838, 31660, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Good colors and exposure.  I think sharper focus on the model would have been a better choice. Cat is a bit wiggly, but aren''t they all.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Good colors and exposure.  I think sharper focus on the model would have been a better choice. Cat is a bit wiggly, but aren''t they all.', '2003-08-06 00:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(377839, 31854, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting exposure, not my cup of tea. I think a sharper focus would have been better.</td>', 'Interesting exposure, not my cup of tea. I think a sharper focus would have been better.', '2003-08-06 01:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
