(379207, 31842, 7758, '<td valign="top">Perfect, this is this week''s standout entry in my opinion. I would be surprised if this does not take the blue ribbon.<br/>As an image it stands up quite well, with only minor, minor adjustments that I would make such as possibly making the image a little more contrasty. But that is pretty minor and is, of course, subjective. There''s nothing you can do about the sky which is about the only detraction from the image at all.<br/>Love the detail you have gone to here, white socks.... and even the checked shirt. Great shot, thank you, I got a real kick out of this one.... as you have no doubt gathered from the length of my comments... this is head and shoulders above the other shots in this challenge for both originality and relevance to the challenge topic.<br/>If this does not win there is no justice on DPChallenge!<br/>Good Luck, Todd.<br/>Goes without saying that I gave this a 10.</td>', 'Perfect, this is this week''s standout entry in my opinion. I would be surprised if this does not take the blue ribbon.As an image it stands up quite well, with only minor, minor adjustments that I would make such as possibly making the image a little more contrasty. But that is pretty minor and is, of course, subjective. There''s nothing you can do about the sky which is about the only detraction from the image at all.Love the detail you have gone to here, white socks.... and even the checked shirt. Great shot, thank you, I got a real kick out of this one.... as you have no doubt gathered from the length of my comments... this is head and shoulders above the other shots in this challenge for both originality and relevance to the challenge topic.If this does not win there is no justice on DPChallenge!Good Luck, Todd.Goes without saying that I gave this a 10.', '2003-08-06 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
