(380845, 31842, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''m soooooo glad to see someone did this.  This was my idea, too, but my week got busy and then it was too late.  You did a beautiful job - the subject at first glance even appears to really be Tom Hanks due to your excellent composition and having the little suitcase there.  Lovely.  8</td>', 'I''m soooooo glad to see someone did this.  This was my idea, too, but my week got busy and then it was too late.  You did a beautiful job - the subject at first glance even appears to really be Tom Hanks due to your excellent composition and having the little suitcase there.  Lovely.  8', '2003-08-07 15:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(380846, 31815, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro shot... I love the fantastic detail, rich color and very shallow DOF.  The connection to the movie is a bit tenuous in my opinion, however.  --8</td>', 'Fantastic macro shot... I love the fantastic detail, rich color and very shallow DOF.  The connection to the movie is a bit tenuous in my opinion, however.  --8', '2003-08-07 15:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
