(382625, 31769, 8637, '<td valign="top">Well, nice shot but the mood of Deliverance was more the people and the water than the houses.   The ends of the logs also seem a bit soft/fuzzy, would have been better to include the other column in the image...perhaps a shot from the moss covered stump would add more character to the shot.</td>', 'Well, nice shot but the mood of Deliverance was more the people and the water than the houses.   The ends of the logs also seem a bit soft/fuzzy, would have been better to include the other column in the image...perhaps a shot from the moss covered stump would add more character to the shot.', '2003-08-09 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
