(382928, 31621, 11074, '<td valign="top">I like the way the subject appears to be totally absorbed in the "movie".  Good commentary on the vacuous nature of televised entertainment.</td>', 'I like the way the subject appears to be totally absorbed in the "movie".  Good commentary on the vacuous nature of televised entertainment.', '2003-08-10 00:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(382975, 31852, 4805, '<td valign="top">Brad Pitt EXACTLY...how''d you get ''im for yer shot? Ahh but seriously...not sure the toning here is exactly cinematic. It look muddy, like he''s fishing in the sewer. Maybe a blue duotone? Basic black and white? Almost all flyfishing shots have the whole rod showing at least. I''d really like to see a wider angle with the rod tip included to the left, and the loop of line included as well. It seems heavily cropped and missing a whole lot.</td>', 'Brad Pitt EXACTLY...how''d you get ''im for yer shot? Ahh but seriously...not sure the toning here is exactly cinematic. It look muddy, like he''s fishing in the sewer. Maybe a blue duotone? Basic black and white? Almost all flyfishing shots have the whole rod showing at least. I''d really like to see a wider angle with the rod tip included to the left, and the loop of line included as well. It seems heavily cropped and missing a whole lot.', '2003-08-10 03:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(382981, 31813, 2011, '<td valign="top">You get a 10 for the picture and for picking one cool ass movie!  ; )</td>', 'You get a 10 for the picture and for picking one cool ass movie!  ; )', '2003-08-10 04:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(382990, 31774, 7857, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, excellent use of light and shadow to bring across the feelings from the film, I also like the detail from the wood grain (nice choice of setting, gives it more feeling). Nice sharp focus, a little more definition from the blade would have made this shot even better, good work - 9<br/>EDIT - spelling mistake<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-11 06:34:02.</i></td>', 'I love this shot, excellent use of light and shadow to bring across the feelings from the film, I also like the detail from the wood grain (nice choice of setting, gives it more feeling). Nice sharp focus, a little more definition from the blade would have made this shot even better, good work - 9EDIT - spelling mistake', '2003-08-10 07:23:24.000000', '2003-08-11 07:34:02.000000', 1),
(382992, 31850, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice choice. The moody lighting works really well here. Nice sharp focus, good colour, good luck.</td>', 'Nice choice. The moody lighting works really well here. Nice sharp focus, good colour, good luck.', '2003-08-10 07:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382993, 31840, 7857, '<td valign="top">Like the back lighting here, very effective but you''ve still picked up lots of detail from the mask as well. Good job.</td>', 'Like the back lighting here, very effective but you''ve still picked up lots of detail from the mask as well. Good job.', '2003-08-10 07:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(382994, 31813, 7857, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t until I saw the whole pick that I saw the name on the bottom, thats good attention to detail. Nice work, nice choice. Focus is good as is the positioning of the pieces. Good luck</td>', 'Wasn''t until I saw the whole pick that I saw the name on the bottom, thats good attention to detail. Nice work, nice choice. Focus is good as is the positioning of the pieces. Good luck', '2003-08-10 07:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(382995, 31855, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like 2 guys out there.  The picture is a little grainy too down to where the water meets the sand.</td>', 'Looks like 2 guys out there.  The picture is a little grainy too down to where the water meets the sand.', '2003-08-10 07:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(382996, 31670, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice picture.  Applicable to the challenge?  Big big stretch.  I''m not thinking they have mountains like this in Kansas.  I could be wrong, But from what I remember Auntie Ems Place was mighty flat.  Great colors for this rainbow,  good find and good capture</td>', 'This is a pretty nice picture.  Applicable to the challenge?  Big big stretch.  I''m not thinking they have mountains like this in Kansas.  I could be wrong, But from what I remember Auntie Ems Place was mighty flat.  Great colors for this rainbow,  good find and good capture', '2003-08-10 08:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(382997, 31545, 3540, '<td valign="top">This could''ve used a little tighter crop IMO.  Swans are just not quite the subject they could be if they were a little closer.  Nice colors and a very peaceful atmosphere.</td>', 'This could''ve used a little tighter crop IMO.  Swans are just not quite the subject they could be if they were a little closer.  Nice colors and a very peaceful atmosphere.', '2003-08-10 08:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(382998, 31774, 3540, '<td valign="top">Horror movies rock.  This is a very good picture.  black and white really works for this one well.  Nice job!</td>', 'Horror movies rock.  This is a very good picture.  black and white really works for this one well.  Nice job!', '2003-08-10 08:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(382999, 31660, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice picture, better if it was focused.  Its just a little too soft for my tastes.  Good concept, although I admit I''ve never heard of the movie.  But that won''t count against you.</td>', 'This is a pretty nice picture, better if it was focused.  Its just a little too soft for my tastes.  Good concept, although I admit I''ve never heard of the movie.  But that won''t count against you.', '2003-08-10 08:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(383003, 31842, 3306, '<td valign="top">very good. made me laugh. 10</td>', 'very good. made me laugh. 10', '2003-08-10 09:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(383101, 31789, 7711, '<td valign="top">I remember watching this movie with my dad years ago. He really liked war movies and history films..I remember the colouring of the movie being very much like this, and the images in it are echoed well in this shot. There is a peacefulness on the surface, but you can sense some tension just below. Very well done. 10</td>', 'I remember watching this movie with my dad years ago. He really liked war movies and history films..I remember the colouring of the movie being very much like this, and the images in it are echoed well in this shot. There is a peacefulness on the surface, but you can sense some tension just below. Very well done. 10', '2003-08-10 13:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(383102, 31824, 7711, '<td valign="top">I just watched this on television the other day! highlights are a bit blown out, but I like the difusion sort of glow it has, the print of the old movie was coloured much like this, you''ve done a good job! 8</td>', 'I just watched this on television the other day! highlights are a bit blown out, but I like the difusion sort of glow it has, the print of the old movie was coloured much like this, you''ve done a good job! 8', '2003-08-10 13:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(383105, 31667, 6900, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t do anything for me.  It''s overprocessed and I can''t really identify with it or identify anything in it.  I don''t like the Photoshop/PSP processing and I think the lack of detail hurts the image.</td>', 'This picture doesn''t do anything for me.  It''s overprocessed and I can''t really identify with it or identify anything in it.  I don''t like the Photoshop/PSP processing and I think the lack of detail hurts the image.', '2003-08-10 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(383107, 31606, 6900, '<td valign="top">The challenge was to take a picture of a movie scene and you took a picture of a movie title.  Not the same thing imo.  Also - it''s not a very visually appealing shot.  The grease turns into white spots on the camera and frying food is generally "ugly" (no offense to your photography, only to this particular photo lol)</td>', 'The challenge was to take a picture of a movie scene and you took a picture of a movie title.  Not the same thing imo.  Also - it''s not a very visually appealing shot.  The grease turns into white spots on the camera and frying food is generally "ugly" (no offense to your photography, only to this particular photo lol)', '2003-08-10 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(383109, 31857, 6900, '<td valign="top">Humorous take on the challenge - but if that bus says "Queens" wouldn''t it have been more appropriate to leave it in?  LOL  Nice colors and "pose."</td>', 'Humorous take on the challenge - but if that bus says "Queens" wouldn''t it have been more appropriate to leave it in?  LOL  Nice colors and "pose."', '2003-08-10 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(383111, 31768, 6900, '<td valign="top">Solid 9 from me.  I would have posed it and cropped it a bit higher - it looks like it''s pointing at the baby, which is scary enough!  I like that you have a victim but it''s hard to figure it out in two seconds - it takes a few more (cuz most people aren''t shaped like that).  I love this photo and hate you for it!</td>', 'Solid 9 from me.  I would have posed it and cropped it a bit higher - it looks like it''s pointing at the baby, which is scary enough!  I like that you have a victim but it''s hard to figure it out in two seconds - it takes a few more (cuz most people aren''t shaped like that).  I love this photo and hate you for it!', '2003-08-10 13:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(383112, 31786, 6900, '<td valign="top">Funny but I don''t remember this scene.</td>', 'Funny but I don''t remember this scene.', '2003-08-10 13:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(383114, 31476, 6900, '<td valign="top">Would have been a much better shot with just the road and maybe someone''s feet in slippers on it.  A good subject, but doesn''t fit "movie scene" very well.</td>', 'Would have been a much better shot with just the road and maybe someone''s feet in slippers on it.  A good subject, but doesn''t fit "movie scene" very well.', '2003-08-10 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(383116, 31778, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Bad movie scene. lol</td>', 'Nice picture. Bad movie scene. lol', '2003-08-10 14:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(383117, 31815, 6900, '<td valign="top">You took a picture of a movie title when the challenge was to take one of a movie scene...I think that''ll hurt your score a LOT. This shot is overall not bad.  I may have moved a leaf or two to expose more of the nice reds.</td>', 'You took a picture of a movie title when the challenge was to take one of a movie scene...I think that''ll hurt your score a LOT. This shot is overall not bad.  I may have moved a leaf or two to expose more of the nice reds.', '2003-08-10 14:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(383119, 31757, 6900, '<td valign="top">Preposed for you, but not a bad idea.  Your crop, but not sure that I''m voting on the photo or the detail in the dolls... Could use a bit more contrast overall.</td>', 'Preposed for you, but not a bad idea.  Your crop, but not sure that I''m voting on the photo or the detail in the dolls... Could use a bit more contrast overall.', '2003-08-10 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(383121, 31787, 6900, '<td valign="top">Too white on the forehead.  Interesting picture, but try a smaller aperture (larger number) to throw the BG out of focus (if your cam allows this).</td>', 'Too white on the forehead.  Interesting picture, but try a smaller aperture (larger number) to throw the BG out of focus (if your cam allows this).', '2003-08-10 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(383127, 31554, 2567, '<td valign="top">Good color and composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good color and composition.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 14:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(383128, 31842, 2567, '<td valign="top">Like the composition.  Good choice for black and white.  Good luck.</td>', 'Like the composition.  Good choice for black and white.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(383129, 31838, 2567, '<td valign="top">I love the color in this shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the color in this shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 14:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(383132, 31647, 2567, '<td valign="top">Good dof, clarity, and colors.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good dof, clarity, and colors.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(383133, 31768, 2567, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition.  Good choice for black and white.  Good luck.</td>', 'Terrific composition.  Good choice for black and white.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 14:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(383139, 30963, 2337, '<td valign="top">Although voting should be about the image, I have to tell you your title is probably hurting your score.  It''s more like a book then a title.  The image itself has a certain symmetrical appeal.</td>', 'Although voting should be about the image, I have to tell you your title is probably hurting your score.  It''s more like a book then a title.  The image itself has a certain symmetrical appeal.', '2003-08-10 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(383153, 31342, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, good composition and coloring.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice angle, good composition and coloring.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(383155, 31778, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a gun but this did not really depict a scene in my view.</td>', 'Nice photo of a gun but this did not really depict a scene in my view.', '2003-08-10 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(383156, 31769, 2567, '<td valign="top">This looks overexposed to me.  Deeper colors would have made a terrific shot.<br/></td>', 'This looks overexposed to me.  Deeper colors would have made a terrific shot.', '2003-08-10 15:46:22.000000', NULL, 1);
