(383587, 30912, 200, '<td valign="top">The girls at work will be thrilled! They asked me non stop how the darn thing was scoring...cant wait to tell them it won a ribbon. Thanks for the comments...we had a lot of fun with this. That irritating white thing in the lower  corner is actually supposed to be scary. Its a papoose restraint thing. Oh well...didnt photograph too well. The patients face was just too perfect in this shot...so had to go with it.</td>', 'The girls at work will be thrilled! They asked me non stop how the darn thing was scoring...cant wait to tell them it won a ribbon. Thanks for the comments...we had a lot of fun with this. That irritating white thing in the lower  corner is actually supposed to be scary. Its a papoose restraint thing. Oh well...didnt photograph too well. The patients face was just too perfect in this shot...so had to go with it.', '2003-08-11 01:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(383588, 30912, 9893, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this image is wonderful. It really make it feel like an old movie =)</td>', 'The contrast in this image is wonderful. It really make it feel like an old movie =)', '2003-08-11 01:05:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(383590, 31852, 811, '<td valign="top">Yea, yea, yea.  I was so bored by the book, figured I''d avoid the movie.  The river was a brownish color, mainly because of the unbelievable amount of rain we''ve had this summer, particularly this day.  I have no idea who this guy is -- just some poor guy who was the only fly fisherman I could find on the river.<br/> <br/>I would have had the whole rod showing, but then you would have seen what a mess his line was in (I think he was just learning or something).  Also, I am on a quest to find out what the heck that pixelation stuff is -- it''s not from compression, as you can see it in the original, but not at full size.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Yea, yea, yea.  I was so bored by the book, figured I''d avoid the movie.  The river was a brownish color, mainly because of the unbelievable amount of rain we''ve had this summer, particularly this day.  I have no idea who this guy is -- just some poor guy who was the only fly fisherman I could find on the river. I would have had the whole rod showing, but then you would have seen what a mess his line was in (I think he was just learning or something).  Also, I am on a quest to find out what the heck that pixelation stuff is -- it''s not from compression, as you can see it in the original, but not at full size. Thanks for the comments.', '2003-08-11 01:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(383591, 31842, 6477, '<td valign="top">YESSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS!!!! I knew you''ll get a ribbon!!!:))))) A great work!<br/>Congrats Pedro!!!!:)) Salud!:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-11 00:07:15.</i></td>', 'YESSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS!!!! I knew you''ll get a ribbon!!!:))))) A great work!Congrats Pedro!!!!:)) Salud!:)', '2003-08-11 01:06:28.000000', '2003-08-11 01:07:15.000000', 0),
(383597, 31308, 2752, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for taking the time to comment.  All are very helpful and I am happy that you enjoyed the set up.  I had fun with it and managed to find a rosebud at a neighbor''s hidden in some tall grass.  I know the movie was in black and white but the rosebud lacked "punch" as black.  Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks to all for taking the time to comment.  All are very helpful and I am happy that you enjoyed the set up.  I had fun with it and managed to find a rosebud at a neighbor''s hidden in some tall grass.  I know the movie was in black and white but the rosebud lacked "punch" as black.  Thanks again.', '2003-08-11 01:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
