(384038, 31768, 2716, '<td valign="top">Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee.  Another purty wibbon.  Next goal ... get a nice yellow one.  :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the kind words.  I guess I was a bit surprised of doing so well.  Psycho is the only movie scene I could think of and time was running out.  I guess it pays to just submit a shot for the fun of it, from time to time.  <br/> <br/>I had a score of 8.545 after 11 votes.  I even took a screen print.  lol.  <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/19978936" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here is the screen capture</a></td>', 'Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee.  Another purty wibbon.  Next goal ... get a nice yellow one.  :) Thanks for all the kind words.  I guess I was a bit surprised of doing so well.  Psycho is the only movie scene I could think of and time was running out.  I guess it pays to just submit a shot for the fun of it, from time to time.   I had a score of 8.545 after 11 votes.  I even took a screen print.  lol.  Here is the screen capture', '2003-08-11 09:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
